{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_24_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0012"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0012_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "- Jack Shern, M.D.", "semantic_text": "- Jack Shern, M.D.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0012_geometry", "bbox": [452, 936, 629, 961], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0012"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_27/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0024/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_24_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0013"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0013_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "The scientists searched for genetic\nmutations that could help predict\nhow well children with RMS would\nrespond to treatment. They found\nmutations in several genes that seem\nto be connected to a more aggressive\nform of the disease and a lower\nchance of survival.", "semantic_text": "The scientists searched for genetic mutations that could help predict how well children with RMS would respond to treatment. They found mutations in several genes that seem to be connected to a more aggressive form of the disease and a lower chance of survival.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0013_geometry", "bbox": [454, 1036, 773, 1236], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0013"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_27/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0024/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_24_HY_007", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0014"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0014_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "“These discoveries change what we\ndo with these patients. They trigger a\nlot of really important research into\ndeveloping new therapies that target\nthese mutations,” said Javed Khan,\nM.D., of NCI’s Genetics Branch, who\nled the study.", "semantic_text": "“These discoveries change what we do with these patients. They trigger a lot of really important research into developing new therapies that target these mutations,” said Javed Khan, M.D., of NCI’s Genetics Branch, who led the study.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0014_geometry", "bbox": [454, 1237, 774, 1410], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0014"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_27/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0024/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_24_HY_008", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0015", "D0016"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0015_F001", "D0016_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "The standard therapy for RMS\ninvolves a year of chemotherapy,\nradiation therapy, and surgery. That\nmeans children with this cancer get\na lot of toxic treatments, said study\nco-author Jack Shern, M.D., of NCI's\nPediatric Oncology Branch.", "semantic_text": "The standard therapy for RMS involves a year of chemotherapy, radiation therapy, and surgery. That means children with this cancer get\na lot of toxic treatments, said study co-author Jack Shern, M.D., of NCI's Pediatric Oncology Branch.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0015_geometry", "bbox": [454, 1411, 761, 1510], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0015"}, {"member_id": "D0016_geometry", "bbox": [806, 1036, 1120, 1111], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0016"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_27/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0024/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021_24_HY_009", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0017"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0017_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "\"If we can predict who's going to\ndo well and who's not, then we can\nreally start to tailor our therapies\nor eliminate therapies that aren't\ngoing to be effective in a particular\npatient,\" Dr. Shern said. \"For the\nchildren who aren't going to do well,\nthis allows us to think about new\nways to treat them.\"", "semantic_text": "\"If we can predict who's going to do well and who's not, then we can really start to tailor our therapies or eliminate therapies that aren't going to be effective in a particular patient,\" Dr. Shern said. \"For the children who aren't going to do well, this allows us to think about new ways to treat them.\"", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0017_geometry", "bbox": [806, 1112, 1122, 1335], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0017"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_snapshot_non_nasa_20261118_2243_v2/batch_27/hybrid/real_068_batch_63_NIHMLPFall2021/page_0024/decisions.json"}
